Below are two small patches to wire up a matching `id` on the expand‐all header cell and then pass that same id into each expandable row so that the `<td headers="…">` will point at a real `<th id="…">`. Both changes live in DataTable.js.

1) **Add an `id`** to the props returned by `getExpandHeaderProps`, based on the table’s unique prefix.  
2) **Inject that same id** into each row’s `expandHeader` prop in `getRowProps`.  

