With these two edits:

- The `<th>` for expand‐all will render with an `id="data-table-{n}__expand"`.  
- Every `<TableExpandRow>` will automatically get `expandHeader="data-table-{n}__expand"`, so its `<td headers="…">` points at a real header.

This should satisfy the IBM Equal Access checker (no more “headers attribute value does not reference a valid id”).
